[{"title":"送王抚干行甫","author":"王十朋","text":"之子来夔子，春江又绿波。\n分符惭政拙，赞画赖才多。\n翰墨妙挥染，词章工琢磨。\n扁舟先吾去，送别奈愁何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18440,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡圃无海棠买数根殖之","author":"王十朋","text":"少陵诗史有遗阙，海棠名花辄湮没。\n孤芳千载逢苏仙，竹篱一笑嫣然发。\n我从蜀锦亭边来，遥入苍苍烟雨窟。\n绮霞晓抹神女肌，香醪春醉明妃骨。\n鲜鲜丝蕊垂更袅，点点燕脂匀未歇。\n半含欲吐不胜情，沐露梳风睡明月。\n为开酒尊苦多病，欲插一枝羞白发。\n照眼千株未观蜀，回首十年深忆越。\n何人好事呼名友，姚魏不容矜阀阅。\n凝香有地胡不植，负郭无园何处谒。\n不烦飞鹄衔子来，自买芳根带花掘。\n明年高堂来燕子，想见繁红映林樾。\n栽花老守在何许，雁荡山中采薇蕨。\n凭谁为问花消息，有梦遥惊山突兀。\n自惭不是召伯棠，那得诗人歌勿伐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18441,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭纯老","author":"王十朋","text":"忽得潜涧书，惊闻寿山死。\n开书未终读，老泪洒盈纸。\n寿山僧中杰，萧洒如晋人。\n识高行孤洁，匈无一点尘。\n少年走江湖，丛林参大士。\n莫年住瓯闽，道价高远迩。\n桑下不留恋，急流猛抽身。\n我欲挂衣冠，归欤远公亲。\n遽闻新塔成，已葬坚固子。\n无由访圆泽，空对瞿唐水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18442,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵喻叔奇松竹图","author":"王十朋","text":"只应王子猷相爱，未许秦皇帝可亲。\n画我同年作三友，岁寒节操宰官身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18443,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄巫山图与林致一喻叔奇 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"图画巫山十二峰，缄题遥寄旧游从。\n烦君子细看山色，不似老夫归意浓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18444,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄巫山图与林致一喻叔奇 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"数千里外共明月，十二峰头望故乡。\n我对此山无梦寐，梦魂只在雁山傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18445,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 屈大夫","author":"王十朋","text":"大夫楚忠臣，哀哉以谗逐。\n遗庙大江濆，醒清今古独。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18446,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 严刺史","author":"王十朋","text":"将军头可断，讵肯以城降。\n斯可为忠矣，至今名此邦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18447,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 诸葛武侯","author":"王十朋","text":"卧龙起南阳，不为鼎一足。\n托名蜀丞相，相汉非相蜀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18448,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 少陵先生","author":"王十朋","text":"子美稷禼志，空抱竟无用。\n夔州三百篇，高配风雅颂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18449,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 陆宣公","author":"王十朋","text":"敬舆避谗谤，闭门不著书。\n活人集名方，炳然仁谊馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18450,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 韦丞相","author":"王十朋","text":"韦侯守盛山，赋诗十二首。\n能以尧事君，遂令诗不朽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18451,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 白文公","author":"王十朋","text":"赋咏穷三峡，乐天在忠州。\n苟不以直道，亦如元与刘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18452,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 柳文公","author":"王十朋","text":"柳公本书生，忠勇著岳鄂。\n盛山戮奸吏，馀威震夷落。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18453,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 寇莱公","author":"王十朋","text":"莱公经济业，志在巴东诗。\n斯人不复见，亭上秋风悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18454,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夔路十贤 唐质肃公","author":"王十朋","text":"子方筮仕初，牛刀割鱼复。\n一朝峨廌冠，风采百僚肃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18455,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续访得七人 宋大夫","author":"王十朋","text":"述志哀正则，陈词讽灵脩。\n读君九辨章，悲楚非悲秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18456,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续访得七人 源丞相","author":"王十朋","text":"杰人掾夔子，相业光开元。\n故宅半赤甲，荒凉今不存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18457,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续访得七人 李左相","author":"王十朋","text":"罢相避同列，衔杯乐圣人。\n那知偃月堂，中有丞相瞋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18458,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续访得七人 李丞相","author":"王十朋","text":"公在忠州日，人高长者风。\n忮心无后段，宁愧赞皇公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18459,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续访得七人 温御史","author":"王十朋","text":"谁坐绣衣石，曾落金吾胆。\n不戮拥靴人，至今有馀憾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18460,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续访得七人 程伊川","author":"王十朋","text":"轲伋诚明学，弟兄传以心。\n易微于九师，闭门自钩深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18461,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续访得七人 黄太史","author":"王十朋","text":"豫章官逸远，直笔非谤史。\n天遣来黔涪，诗鸣配子美。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18462,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柏架","author":"王十朋","text":"青铜柯叶胜杉松，带得清风下卧龙。\n日莫微凉起高架，移床却扇坐从容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18463,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵林江州题高远亭","author":"王十朋","text":"眼明庐阜翠横空，疑是云头屹夏峰。\n遗迹君应怀圣治，故家我亦念归宗。\n遥瞻瀑水三千尺，犹隔巫山十二重。\n亭上主人高更远，天然丘壑在心匈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18464,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登制胜楼","author":"王十朋","text":"梁栋翚飞百尺楼，江山满目壮夔州。\n鸟穿云过白盐去，鱼透浪来清瀼游。\n控扼地临三峡险，朝宗水会百川流。\n古今制胜人何胜，天下奇才忠武侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18465,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再用前韵","author":"王十朋","text":"下视瞿唐缥渺楼，规模雄压十三州。\n良筹合向暇时运，缓带宜来高处游。\n列障四时环坐好，大江千古抱城流。\n后山植木成阴日，谁识十年前故侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18466,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送宋山甫知县","author":"王十朋","text":"君住眉山我永嘉，老来邂逅楚天涯。\n无诗不和已成杜，有酒相呼如在家。\n官职未高名满蜀，人才如许邑为巴。\n且将异日作霖手，润泽河阳一县花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18467,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月一日","author":"王十朋","text":"天涯逢六月，深忆别家时。\n行也亦云远，归欤何太迟。\n殊方最炎热，多病想扶持。\n天遣西来意，端令啖荔枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18468,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食荔枝 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"荔枝初熟饤金盆，手擘轻红子细看。\n风味由来太奇绝，不教容易到长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18469,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食荔枝 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"妃子园中荔子奇，莫因名号起猜疑。\n清时入坐非尤物，一洗烟尘赖好诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18470,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食荔枝 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"诗史堂前种几时，轻红曾入少陵诗。\n殊方竞续樱桃献，万树争先尔独迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18471,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拾荔枝核欲种之戏成一首","author":"王十朋","text":"海味正思瑶柱美，夔门又见荔枝红。\n炎方入贡自妃子，郡圃欲栽如白公。\n官满犹为十年计，实成须待二星终。\n不须更论何时吃，前种后收人我同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18472,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幼女生日","author":"王十朋","text":"林钟蓂四荚，吾女此时生。\n日向炎天永，月从前夜明。\n提携仰慈母，教诲赖诸兄。\n愿汝康而寿，人如少蕴清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18473,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗史堂荔枝歌","author":"王十朋","text":"君不见诗人以来一子美，莫年流落来夔子。\n赋诗三百六十篇，西瀼东屯客愁里。\n何人作堂画遗像，收拾光芒榜诗史。\n堂前何有有荔枝，树犹未老熟独迟。\n世人贵早不贵晚，倘非我辈谁赏之。\n涪陵昔遭妃子污，万颗包羞莫能诉。\n泸戎一经少陵擘，至今传诵轻红句。\n少陵伤时泪成血，一点丹心不磨灭。\n散成朱实满炎方，风味如诗两奇绝。\n乐天曾画忠州图，自言香味人间无。\n君谟亦作闽中谱，陈紫声名重南土。\n何如诗史堂前株，正是一饭孤忠馀。\n人为世重物亦重，端如丈人屋上乌。\n巴图闽谱合避路，奚用品第分锱铢。\n搀先熟者如杨卢，但可与之作前驱。\n闽娘十八婢妾尔，将军大树真佣奴。\n我生四百馀年后，来作先生游处守。\n登堂三叹荔正丹，聊效柳人祠子厚。\n安得先生今复生，添赋夔州歌一首，要使荔枝之名长不朽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18474,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"周行可挽诗 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"我始来夔子，公先在计台。\n江山同吊古，文字共衔杯。\n马运言尤力，天高听未回。\n怀人梦不见，西望肺肝摧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18475,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"周行可挽诗 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"大事同生日，佳城近故丘。\n空留丹灶药，忍望白云楼。\n偃折恩谁继，澄清志未酬。\n伤哉葬元伯，执绋竟无由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18476,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过客谈梁彭州之政不容口闻为虚额所困欲引去予愿其少留以福千里辄寄恶诗","author":"王十朋","text":"籍甚吾年友，彭州誉正驰。\n那因困虚额，遽欲丐真祠。\n勿谓徒劳耳，终须日教之。\n家传治称最，自有九重知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18477,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食薏苡粥","author":"王十朋","text":"夔州再见夏，炎瘴侵我肌。\n两股忽浮肿，百药竟未治。\n或言薏苡良，可以作粥糜。\n恐坐伏波谤，腹中有珠玑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18478,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十贤堂栽竹","author":"王十朋","text":"六月修篁带雨移，丁宁护取岁寒枝。\n十贤清节高千古，不是此君谁与宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18479,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗史堂荔枝晚熟而佳预约同官共赏偶成参差摘实分饷因诵庐陵先生诗云人生此事尚难必况欲功名书鼎彝复用前韵以歌之","author":"王十朋","text":"诗史堂前荔支晚尤美，高压泸戎与妃子。\n姓名犹未闻峡中，风味惟应自皮里。\n试将远况江瑶柱，正似骚人拟良史。\n我来叹息颐屡支，殊方争献惟恐迟。\n汝今已晚何用好，不是少陵谁眼之。\n贵妃游魂遭血污，玉坐悲怀何以诉。\n惟有云安再拜人，闷解夔州两绝句。\n遗像空存食不血，满目烟霞明自灭。\n何人种此星几终，一树团团味奇绝。\n君不见南宾木莲有华何足图，乐夫过虑重看无。\n又不见洛阳牡丹妖艳何必谱，六一区区记风土。\n天生此果更此株，夏日之时见子馀。\n昼疑炎方张火伞，夕讶庭树栖赤乌。\n双头瑩若玉一瑴，细骨轻于钱五铢。\n陈江阀阅如崔卢，兹产于闽必争驱。\n甜无中边大胜蜜，酝酿不假蜂为奴。\n永安宫西郡堂后，折简呼宾老太守。\n时方炎热会苦稀，事好乖违意徒厚。\n手摘高枝赠丹实，歌和前篇搔白首。\n嗟一饷之乐兮，天亦悭于老朽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18480,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏日与同僚游三友亭","author":"王十朋","text":"炎天过小雨，伏日生微凉。\n新亭会僚友，故事开壶觞。\n泉汲卧龙乳，茶烹团凤香。\n缅怀去年友，跳珠出诗章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18481,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"分韵得炎字","author":"王十朋","text":"两载夔子国，尤苦夏日炎。\n稚金又云伏，老火犹未潜。\n呼宾江上亭，风雄雨纤纤。\n仰知九重心，勃郁念闾阎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18482,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"制胜楼有元丰间太守王延禧及计台郡僚过客唱和诗大书于版岁久字漫命笔吏再书之记以数语","author":"王十朋","text":"周室禾黍过者伤，汉宫威仪见之喜。\n神州久没馀楚蜀，太平声诗存有几。\n制胜楼头诗数版，仍是元丰旧臣子。\n体格犹存前辈风，气象如楼颇奇伟。\n人虽不见典刑在，事尚能言文献是。\n岁月侵寻自漫灭，爱礼存羊那忍毁。\n百年陈迹一旦新，不问升沉与工鄙。\n一洗向来官职眼，独刊无尽张居士。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18483,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雷声","author":"王十朋","text":"雷已先声雷隐隐，雨宜洒道即纷纷。\n为言风伯不须怒，天下苍生正望云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18484,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"某二年于夔窃食而已无德于民尤无功于学校泮宫诸生相与肖其象而祠之意固厚矣然非所宜得呈苏校授","author":"王十朋","text":"一麾出守喜来夔，日与诸生泳圣涯。\n窃取于城勉忠孝，来能如衮进文词。\n从公于迈误成颂，尔貌不扬何足祠。\n为语广文休作记，粗沙大石定磨碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18485,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻得吴兴","author":"王十朋","text":"莫年身似杜陵翁，流落乌蛮白帝中。\n圣主哀怜不终弃，乞祠却得水晶宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18486,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕呈同官","author":"王十朋","text":"今夕何夕夕云七，天孙有巧不愿乞。\n举杯遥指河汉头，但愿归耕学牵牛。\n我无腹中书可晒，亦不晒衣随俗辈。\n缑山未访仙祖游，夔门聊与嘉宾会。\n星河动摇三峡流，人间天上同新秋。\n鹊已成桥动归翮，我亦一枝栖可得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18487,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别夔州三绝 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"朅来夔子两经年，恰是忠州白乐天。\n种柳栽花一般意，愧无名德比前贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18488,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别夔州三绝 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"夔峡民淳狱讼稀，使君无事只吟诗。\n才疏政拙形容陋，深愧邦人为立祠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18489,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别夔州三绝 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"阵图入眼浑如梦，回首江山又梦间。\n万里白云遮望眼，□□□□□□□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18490,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠牟童子","author":"王十朋","text":"牟家六岁好男儿，诵得夔州太守诗。\n好把五车书尽读，早成头角上天池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18491,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别同官","author":"王十朋","text":"两年窃禄古夔州，邂逅诸君亦宦游。\n为郡不才真下下，同僚多助却优优。\n及瓜便合扁舟去，行李聊为一饭留。\n掺别相期可无语，君亲恩重各宜酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18492,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月十七日离夔州是夜宿瞿唐","author":"王十朋","text":"邦人送别亦伤情，杨柳阴中涕泣声。\n我亦怜夔不忍去，一宵留宿旧江城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18493,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至东屯谒少陵祠 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"宦游夔子两经年，未到东屯意慊然。\n端为先生旧吟处，不应容易上诗篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18494,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至东屯谒少陵祠 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"忠不忘君句有神，当时无地可容身。\n草堂遗像英灵在，又见匙翻雪稻新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18495,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东屯溪山之胜似吾家左原","author":"王十朋","text":"东屯别是一山川，水秀山青似左原。\n我待还家筑茅屋，作诗招取少陵魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18496,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登古峰岭望夔州","author":"王十朋","text":"巍登古峰岭，回首望夔州。\n隐约瞻卧龙，微茫见江流。\n明朝望眼遮，江山见无由。\n翻令还乡梦，飞过白盐头。\n不知此邦人，亦念使君不。\n使君无可念，空有诗篇留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18497,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古峰驿小饮","author":"王十朋","text":"老去最惜别，同僚情更钟。\n三杯古峰驿，添我别情浓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18498,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"燕子坡","author":"王十朋","text":"燕子归期近，吾今亦得归。\n乌栖一枝稳，何必更高飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18499,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼巫山赵宰","author":"王十朋","text":"使者追求急，君方归意浓。\n谗言端可畏，鬼物不相容。\n浮世谁无死，良医未易逢。\n我来经旧馆，流涕觉无从。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18500,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巫峡 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"三峡江流七月平，全家东下叶舟轻。\n阳台得得收云雨，放尽峰峦照眼明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18501,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巫峡 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"峡中七月行舟断，我仗孤忠尽室行。\n寄语后人宜自戒，莫因幸免遂轻生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18502,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巫峡 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"正是瞿唐莫下时，却将行止问舟师。\n老夫也是归心急，不记前吟滟滪诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18503,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"神女庙","author":"王十朋","text":"功开神禹言何妄，梦恼襄王事亦非。\n峰下祠荒少人到，峡中舟过有乌飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18504,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昭君村","author":"王十朋","text":"十二巫峰下，明妃生处村。\n至今粗丑女，灼面亦成痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18505,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过大拽","author":"王十朋","text":"大拽今重过，江山记我无。\n云开列嶂秀，石峙一峰孤。\n吏卒送迎异，舟车来往殊。\n鸿留泥上迹，飞去到江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18506,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石门","author":"王十朋","text":"兵忿虽云败，君臣义有馀。\n石门能脱急，风义亦堪书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18507,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]